  '源码一行没改，新加的观察动作是在哪个阶段出现的？':'The source was not changed; during which stage do the new observability actions appear?','在构建阶段：工具先准备规则和依赖，再让编译器处理改写后的代码。运行时执行的是这份加工后的二进制。':'During the build: the tool prepares rules and dependencies, then lets the compiler process rewritten input. At run time, this processed binary is executed.','“兼容”不只有 Go 版本一个数字，还包括目标库的版本区间和 runtime 内部结构。三者要一起看。':'“Compatibility” is more than one Go version number: it also includes the target library’s version range and runtime internals. Consider all three together.','GLS 是补救手段，不等于可以不传 context。预创建的 worker、消息队列等交接点仍可能接错父节点。':'GLS is a fallback, not permission to omit context. Handoffs such as pre-created workers and message queues can still receive the wrong parent.','普通 `go build` 经历解析、类型检查、优化、生成代码与链接；使用工具后，在这些步骤之前增加“预处理”和“埋点”两个阶段。':'Ordinary `go build` parses, type-checks, optimizes, generates code, and links; the tool adds preprocessing and instrumentation before those steps.','两个新阶段并不是替换编译器，而是在调用真实编译器之前准备和改写输入。':'The two new stages do not replace the compiler; they prepare and rewrite input before invoking the real compiler.','预处理选出要用的规则并准备依赖；埋点按规则生成并注入代码，再交给真实编译器。':'Preprocessing selects rules and prepares dependencies; instrumentation generates and injects code according to those rules, then hands it to the real compiler.','官方用一段话带过的“准备依赖”，实际要反复进行：加入 hook 代码会带进新包，新包又可能命中新规则。':'The official one-line “prepare dependencies” step is iterative in practice: hook code brings in new packages, which can match new rules.','先确认问题在哪一层：规则没命中、代码没注入、hook 没执行，还是数据没导出。不同层看不同证据。':'First identify the layer: the rule did not match, code was not injected, the hook did not run, or data was not exported. Each layer has different evidence.',
