  '“目标应用无需改代码”容易被理解成“什么代码都没加”。实际上源码文件不改，观察代码是在**构建期间**被加入的，所以要先分清编译时和运行时。':'“The target application needs no code changes” can sound like “no code is added.” The source files stay unchanged, but observability code is added **during the build**, so first separate build time from run time.',
